rule: DRAFT 비소유자 저장·확정 거부는 dmc·dme 가 같은 VersionStateService/VersionWriteGuard/DraftOwnershipService 로 판정한다
file: src/backend/mdm/lib/src/main/java/com/dongkuk/dmes/mdm/common/version/DefaultVersionWriteGuard.java
test: cd src/backend && JAVA_HOME=/opt/homebrew/opt/openjdk@21/libexec/openjdk.jdk/Contents/Home ./gradlew :mdm:api:test --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dmc.codeItemEdit.CodeItemEditServiceSqliteTest" --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.dme.ruleEdit.RuleTableServiceTest" --tests "com.dongkuk.dmes.mdm.contract.version.DraftOwnershipCrossModuleTest" --fail-fast --console=plain
e2e: no
--- find
            VersionRow row = pre.loadOrConflict(draft);
            requireOwner(row, userId);
            requireRowVersion(row, expectedRowVersion);
--- replace
            VersionRow row = pre.loadOrConflict(draft);
            requireRowVersion(row, expectedRowVersion);
